# The soul gate (ruled 2026-07-11) — the barrier-granularity fixture plus the soul fuel (mirrors demos/2-effects/025-soul-gate.bqn)
# keys mints fresh ids; spawn defaults keep nord and dead 1 (the ghosts remain dead Nords);
# soul has NO default, so a minted ghost takes the type zero 0 and can never pass the gate.
n 6
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4 5
col nord bool 1 1 0 1 0 0
col dead bool 1 0 0 1 0 1
col ghost bool 0 0 0 0 0 0
col soul bool 1 1 0 1 0 0
default nord 1
default dead 1
ja 北 nord
ja 死 dead
ja 幽霊 ghost
ja 魂 soul
